4,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help! I think we should check how people actually get to the library so our new service doesn't fail when things change.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A spirited start, Yumi. However, I suspect we are prone to reinventing the wheel. I'd prefer we look at what has actually been attempted here in the past.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Both are superficial. The real question is whether we have the actual skills on staff to execute these plans, or if we're just adding more weight to a breaking branch.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Shion. However, my primary concern is the structure of our funding. We need to ensure the financial model is sustainable beyond the first year.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just... I worry about the people who can't get here. Maybe we should look at the buses and the roads? Just to be sure.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, I totally agree! If the roads close or buses stop, the service stops. Let's make sure we pick things that show us those risks!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While the weather is certainly a factor, I'm more interested in the ""ghosts"" of our archives. Let's see why previous programs were abandoned.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, nostalgia is useless without a skill audit. I'll be looking into who is actually qualified to supervise new initiatives.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"To avoid the usual second-year budget dip, I will examine the grant terms and the endowment. We need to know how the money is shaped.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll look into the bus links in the outer wards and the winter road closures. I just don't want anyone to be left out.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds like a great plan! I'll take the bus links too, and maybe the road closures, just to double-check with @Daisuke!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, surely we can trust @Daisuke's eyes. I shall focus on the two programmes begun six years ago and the former outreach stops.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll also check the volunteer register. It's a common mistake to assume volunteers can fill professional skill gaps without proper training.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also look into the running and equipment lines from last year. I want to see where the actual leakage occurs in the budget.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,Oh... okay. I'll stick with the bus links and the road closures. I'm sorry if I'm repeating things.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"No need to be sorry, @Daisuke! I'll look into the bus links and the road closures too, just to be super helpful!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Efficiency is a virtue, but I suppose redundancy is a safety net. I am satisfied with my choices.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
